            {
              "id": "4544acc5-4e14-45ac-ab3e-a80e4765f088",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<s><strong>game studies</strong></s><strong> research garden </strong>.🕂. 🂮 . 🍃 ."
            },
            {
              "id": "65489a47-f31d-4271-9286-dd6a05fb16c7",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "〜˚✛｡〜⋄〜˚✛｡〜⋄〜˚✛｡〜⋄〜˚✛｡〜⋄〜˚✛｡〜⋄〜˚✛｡〜"
            },
            {
              "id": "4bf23404-1fc5-4322-bfe0-f67522560629",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em>an attempt toward a cartography of research into the nature of Play, Games and their social, metaphysical, technological, &amp; theological character. If you have found this place, i hope you’ve found its links well, &amp; might find its content helpful. Look `round see this li`l quietfound`d field of ours now bursting forth with flowers, now sheens majestic in His winds!</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "83f1c13c-96cb-4474-941c-e31ba7affdd0",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "a4282b10-b932-49e1-8620-6a1f1cca1f88",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "&gt; <em>It is thus our time of Harvest,</em> <em>&amp; alchemy!</em>"
